{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い日が続きますが、\n皆様体調大丈夫でしょうか(>_<)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は元気です(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鼻うがいが良すぎて学校で\nおすすめしまっくてます♪(´ε｀ )\n(でも友達曰く難しいらしいよ！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも試してみて下さい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回コメントありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンでいてくださる皆さんは\n私の宝物です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は喋ると癖があるので…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"喋らずクール系でいようかなって\n始めは思ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも乃木坂のみんながいい人すぎて、\nすぐに素が出てしまって(⌒-⌒; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…今の私がありのままの私です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのせいで\n芸人さんみたいな喋り方だと\n言われます(；´Д`A"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トークだけじゃなくてパフォーマンスをしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山口百恵さんに憧れてアイドルになったのに、\nなぜ笑いをとらなくちゃいけないんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、そう思ってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は今でもそう思ってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、現時点で、私を見て笑顔になってくださる\nファンの方が1人でもいてくださればそれで充分です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな私ですが\n百恵さんのような素晴らしい表現力を身につけるため、\nこれからも日々努力していきます。\n温かい目で見ていただければ幸いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-----------------------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅうみゅう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とまと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イベントお疲れ様( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして北海道のみなさんに乃木坂46を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝えてくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メは今日のレッスン後☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/03/oo9_3.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また私服が昭和と言われたので！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーデ撮ろうと思ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな入ってくれたの\\(//∇//)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろの方のみんな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見えなくてごめんね(T_T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆さんも大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Special Thanks!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみ＊.°"}],"source":"archive"}